            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>What's Changed



Added predict_ensemble to all model classes by @jsschreck in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/1

Refactored evml to mlguess by @djgagne in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/2

Update of the classifier model by @jsschreck in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/3

Update the annealing term in the DirichletEvidentialLoss  by @dxf424 in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/5

Initiate this_epoch_num in ReportEpoch and DirichletEvidentialLoss by @dxf424 in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/6

Fix environment_casper.yml file to enable GPU by @israt183 in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/7

Start of docs by @djgagne in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/8

PR to get changes in environment_casper.yml and environment.yml integrated into main by @ggantos in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/9

Update docs / change Spectral Norm by @charlie-becker in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/10

Notebook for subsetting p-type data by @djgagne in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/11


New Contributors



@jsschreck made their first contribution in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/1

@djgagne made their first contribution in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/2

@dxf424 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/5

@israt183 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/7

@ggantos made their first contribution in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/9

@charlie-becker made their first contribution in https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/pull/10


Full Changelog: https://github.com/ai2es/miles-guess/commits/v2024.1.0b1</gco:CharacterString>
            </gmd:abstract>

